Route12_Interior1_Text_Fisher_1::
	.string "I’m the FISHING GURU’s younger\n"
	.string "brother.\p"
	.string "I can see that you like fishing.\p"
	.string "There’s no doubt in my mind at all!$"

Route12_Interior1_Text_Fisher_2::
	.string "So? I know I’m right.$"

Route12_Interior1_Text_Fisher_3::
	.string "Huh? My own eyes deceived me?$"

Route12_Interior1_Text_Fisher_4::
	.string "Try your hand at fishing wherever\n"
	.string "there is water.\p"
	.string "Remember--you can catch different\n"
	.string "POKéMON using different RODS.$"

Route12_Interior1_Text_Fisher_5::
	.string "Yes, yes. Just as I thought!\p"
	.string "Here, fishing fan!\n"
	.string "Take this--it’s a SUPER ROD.$"

Route12_Interior1_Text_Sign_1::
	.string "It’s a blank chart of some sort.\p"
	.string "It has spaces for writing in\n"
	.string "records of some kind.$"

Route12_Interior1_Text_Sign_2::
	.string "The most gigantic MAGIKARP\n"
	.string "I have ever witnessed…\p"
	.string "{STR_VAR_3} inches!$"
